4
00:00:13.741 --> 00:00:20.612
Ọmọ naa yẹ ki o dimu ni aabo ati ni itunu boya lori itan tabi lori ejika kan.

5
00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:23.618
O ṣe pataki fun wọn lati lero ailewu.

6
00:00:23.618 --> 00:00:28.341
Bẹrẹ nipa bibeere boya awọn ifiyesi eyikeyi wa nipa idagbasoke gbogbogbo,

7
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:33.065
